emm you might need to call this changed script explicitly.
If I am not mistaken, models are pre-compiled. So even though you changed the stan file, the function call still uses the original one.
You may want to check your fit results:

 f = hbayesdm_results
 f$fit@stanmodel

and to see if the returned model is updated or not.

